{
  "name": "CEDIT 01 — Entrada Omnicanal (Web + Discord)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🏛️ CEDIT — FLUJO 1 (IMPORTAR PRIMERO)\n\n**Entrada:** Webhook `POST /cedit/chat`\n\n**Camino:**\n1. Normalizar payload (mensaje, historial, canal, user_id)\n2. ¿Viene archivo PDF? → FastAPI `/api/upload`\n3. Si no → FastAPI `/api/chat`\n4. ¿Modo auditoría? → llamar **Flujo 2** (blockchain)\n5. Responder al cliente (web o Discord vía n8n)\n\n**Requiere:** FastAPI en puerto 8000 + importar Flujo 2",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-intro",
      "name": "📌 LEER PRIMERO",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-120, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "cedit/chat",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-cedit-chat",
      "name": "🌐 Webhook Chat",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [380, 300],
      "webhookId": "cedit-omnicanal-chat"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.message || $json.message || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "history",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.history || $json.history || [] }}",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "canal",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.canal || $json.canal || 'web' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a4",
              "name": "user_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.user_id || $json.user_id || 'web_anonymous' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a5",
              "name": "is_audit_register",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body?.message || '').includes('[REGISTRO BLOCKCHAIN]') }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-normalize",
      "name": "⚙️ Normalizar payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [620, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.is_audit_register }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-blockchain-only",
      "name": "🔗 ¿Solo registro blockchain?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [860, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5678/webhook-test/cedit/blockchain",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ message: $json.message, user_id: $json.user_id, canal: $json.canal }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-blockchain",
      "name": "⛓️ → Flujo 2 Blockchain",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1100, 180]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-User-Id",
              "value": "={{ $json.user_id }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ message: $json.message, history: $json.history, canal: $json.canal, user_id: $json.user_id }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-fastapi-chat",
      "name": "🧠 FastAPI /api/chat",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1100, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.mode }}",
              "rightValue": "audit",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-audit-mode",
      "name": "📋 ¿Modo auditoría?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1340, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5678/webhook-test/cedit/blockchain",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ message: '[REGISTRO BLOCKCHAIN] ' + ($json.filename || 'auditoria'), user_id: $('⚙️ Normalizar payload').item.json.user_id, canal: $('⚙️ Normalizar payload').item.json.canal, audit_hash: $json.blockchain_payload }) }}",
        "options": { "continueOnFail": true }
      },
      "id": "http-blockchain-after-audit",
      "name": "⛓️ Registrar auditoría",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1580, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { response: $json.display || $json.response, mode: $json.mode, usage: $json.usage, show_pdf: $json.show_pdf, opinion: $json.opinion, strengths: $json.strengths } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "respond-webhook",
      "name": "✅ Responder al cliente",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1820, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔀 RAMAS\n\n**Arriba (true):** mensaje solo blockchain → Flujo 2\n\n**Abajo (false):** chat normal → FastAPI\n\nSi `mode=audit` → registrar en blockchain antes de responder",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-branches",
      "name": "📌 Ramas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [820, 520]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "🌐 Webhook Chat": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "⚙️ Normalizar payload", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "⚙️ Normalizar payload": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "🔗 ¿Solo registro blockchain?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "🔗 ¿Solo registro blockchain?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "⛓️ → Flujo 2 Blockchain", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "🧠 FastAPI /api/chat", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "⛓️ → Flujo 2 Blockchain": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "✅ Responder al cliente", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "🧠 FastAPI /api/chat": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "📋 ¿Modo auditoría?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "📋 ¿Modo auditoría?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "⛓️ Registrar auditoría", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "✅ Responder al cliente", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "⛓️ Registrar auditoría": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "✅ Responder al cliente", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": true
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "tags": [{ "name": "CEDIT" }]
}
